# Core governance for the Mechanistic Agent.
#
# Changes to the deterministic arbiters and to the sources of "truth" (what
# "better" means, holdout protection, model identity/cost) require human core
# review — for EVERY contributor, human or agent. This is the cheap, standard
# mechanism that keeps the SOUL.md autonomy path (Stage 3/4) safe: an automated
# contributor cannot merge a change to the very checks that gate its own work.
#
# Enforcement note: for this to block merges, enable "Require review from Code
# Owners" in the branch protection rules for the default branch.
#
# See CONTRIBUTING.md → "Keyless and agent-authored contributions".

# Deterministic chemistry validators — the final arbiter (SOUL.md Guardrail 1)
/mechanistic_agent/core/validators.py        @scottmreed
/skills/mechanistic/*/validator.py           @scottmreed

# Evidence gate, eval definition, and holdout isolation (what "better" means)
/scripts/validate_prompt_trace_evidence.py   @scottmreed
/training_data/eval_tiers.json               @scottmreed
/training_data/leaderboard_holdout/          @scottmreed

# Model catalog — the single source of model truth (SOUL.md Guardrail 3)
/mechanistic_agent/model_pricing.json        @scottmreed
